+// The classic-Mac pull-down menu bar. For now it is an overlay on the note
+// editor: a single Esc (or a double-tap of the Fn/"Alt" key) opens it, the
+// arrows walk it, Enter runs an item, and the escape ladder is:
+//   Esc        -> leave to the home menu screen
+//   Shift+Esc  -> close and drop the cursor back in the note
+//
+// It will also become the home screen's bar in a later phase, so the module
+// is kept independent of any one host screen.
